{
  "id": "30069_haiden",
  "headword": "{配電|はいでん}",
  "reading": "はいでん",
  "romaji": "haiden",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "power distribution; supply of electricity",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "distribution of electric power; supplying electricity",
      "explanation": "The delivery of electricity from local substations through distribution lines to homes and businesses — the final stage of the power grid, as opposed to long-distance transmission ({送電|そうでん})."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "30069_haiden_ex1",
      "japanese": "この{地域|ちいき}へ{配電|はいでん}する。",
      "english": "Power is distributed to this area.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "30069_haiden_ex2",
      "japanese": "{台風|たいふう}で{配電|はいでん}が{止|と}まった。",
      "english": "Power distribution was cut off by the typhoon.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "30069_haiden_ex3",
      "japanese": "{変電所|へんでんしょ}から{各家庭|かくかてい}へ{電気|でんき}を{配電|はいでん}する{仕組|しく}みだ。",
      "english": "It is a system that distributes electricity from substations to individual households.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Combines {配|はい} (distribute) with {電|でん} (electricity). The final stage of delivering power — from local substations to end users. Used with する.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {配電|はいでん}{盤|ばん}: distribution board; breaker panel\n- {配電|はいでん}{線|せん}: distribution line\n- {配電|はいでん}する: to distribute electricity\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {送電|そうでん}: power transmission — moving electricity long distances at high voltage\n- {発電|はつでん}: power generation — producing the electricity in the first place",
